- Title
- Category tag
- Short summary
- Duration
- Date
- Visual accent mark or waveform
Suggested categories: Soil, Dairy, AgTech, Water, Policy, Seeds
Cards should have bold borders and hover animations.

## 5. Topic Strips / Marquee
A horizontal animated strip with topics:
SOIL HEALTH / ROBOTICS / CROP ROTATION / FARM FINANCE / SEED SCIENCE / WATER RIGHTS / REGENERATIVE GRAZING / FOOD SUPPLY CHAINS
Make the animation smooth but not distracting.

## 6. Hosts Section
